<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Countyglen Irish Stock Exchange listing cancelled.</title>
<headline>Countyglen Irish Stock Exchange listing cancelled.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Irish Stock Exchange said in a statement on Friday that the listing for Countyglen Plc had been cancelled with effect from 1500 GMT (1600 local time).</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9775</p>
